---
const soft = [
  { label: '延迟', value: 62 },
  { label: '损坏', value: 23 },
  { label: '退款', value: 10 },
  { label: '其他', value: 5 },
];
---

<section class="distillation-comparison lesson-diagram not-content" aria-label="知识蒸馏教师学生示意">
  <p class="lesson-diagram__eyebrow">DISTILLATION / 教师到学生</p>
  <h3 class="lesson-diagram__title">软分布把“第二像谁”也交给小模型</h3>
  <div class="distillation-flow">
    <article class="distillation-model distillation-model--teacher">
      <span>TEACHER</span>
      <strong>大模型</strong>
      <small>质量高 · 推理成本高</small>
    </article>
    <div class="distillation-soft" aria-label="教师软化输出教学示意：延迟 62%，损坏 23%，退款 10%，其他 5%">
      <p>温度软化后的类别关系（教学示意）</p>
      {soft.map((item) => (
        <div class="distillation-bar">
          <span>{item.label}</span>
          <i><b style={`inline-size:${item.value}%`}></b></i>
          <small>{item.value}%</small>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <article class="distillation-model distillation-model--student">
      <span>STUDENT</span>
      <strong>小模型</strong>
      <small>任务收窄 · 部署成本低</small>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="lesson-diagram__note">硬标签只给“延迟”一个答案；软分布同时保留“损坏比退款更相近”的类别关系。图中比例相加为 100%，仅用于解释软目标，不代表实验测量值。</p>
</section>
